[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3950356757","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116711#issuecomment-3950356757","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116711","id":3950356757,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rdakV","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-24T09:36:25Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T09:36:25Z","body":"Just to check if I'm understanding this correctly. The purpose of those code snippets:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2327a823578a30f09068f97272598521896d5633/modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp#L2033-L2035\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2327a823578a30f09068f97272598521896d5633/modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp#L1498-L1500\r\n\r\nis to break reference cycles when a function state is referenced from its stack?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3950356757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3951652273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116711#issuecomment-3951652273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116711","id":3951652273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7riW2x","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-24T13:05:27Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T13:05:27Z","body":"> The purpose of those code snippets \\<...\\> is to break reference cycles when a function state is referenced from its stack?\r\n\r\nSee #65910. I'm not sure, but probably the logic behind this is that during `_clear_connections()` the above obtained `GDScriptFunctionState` might be freed, so using the raw pointer `state` again might be unsafe.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2327a823578a30f09068f97272598521896d5633/modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp#L2030-L2035\r\n\r\n> * Need to make sure this doesn't reintroduce #57126.\r\n\r\nI tested this and looked at the code a bit more. It looks like it works correctly. Perhaps the crashes were caused by the `_clear_stack()` call not being protected by a mutex, and the memory leaks were caused by #65910 not being implemented yet. Or maybe it was fixed in a later PR.\r\n\r\nThe current behavior is clearly wrong, and re-adding the `_clear_stack()` call to the `GDScriptFunctionState` destructor seems correct to me. If the instance whose signal `GDScriptFunctionState` is connected to has been freed, the coroutine cannot be resumed under any circumstances, so the saved stack must be cleared regardless of whether the function has completed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3951652273/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3951960804","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116711#issuecomment-3951960804","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116711","id":3951960804,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rjiLk","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-24T13:40:53Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T13:50:59Z","body":"See also:\r\n\r\n* #96441\r\n* #79669\r\n* #84860","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3951960804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3960132401","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116711#issuecomment-3960132401","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116711","id":3960132401,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sCtMx","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T15:34:35Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T15:34:35Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/39601